Package: dayalike
Title: Find the Type of Day That Looks Most Like Yours
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tiansi", "Zhu", , "tzhu0035@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Groups the diary days of the 2025 American Time Use Survey into
    eight day types and compares your own day with them. Includes the
    prepared survey data, functions to match and compare a day, and an
    interactive Shiny app.
